+0 bind(3, ..., ...) = 0
+0 listen(3, 1) = 0

+0 < S 0:0(0) win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0 > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 46720 <mss 1460>
+0 < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535
+0 accept(3, ..., ...) = 4

+0 close(4) = 0
+0 > F. 1:1(0) ack 1 win 46720
+1 > F. 1:1(0) ack 1 win 46720
+2 > F. 1:1(0) ack 1 win 46720
+0 < . 1:1(0) ack 2 win 65535
